---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AppIcon from '../components/common/AppIcon.astro';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../../lib/constants';
---

<Layout
  title="Hubungi Kami & Sekretariat | Mamasar Sumenep"
  description="Kontak resmi layanan pengurus Mamasar, sekretariat PCNU Kabupaten Sumenep, dan saluran bantuan cepat melalui WhatsApp."
  canonicalUrl={`${Astro.url.origin}/kontak`}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-8 sm:py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 space-y-10">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="pb-6 border-b border-slate-200 space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
        <AppIcon name="phone" size="xs" class="text-emerald-700" />
        <span>Saluran Komunikasi Resmi</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Hubungi Kami
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Punya pertanyaan seputar direktori, ingin mengonfirmasi data toko UMKM, atau membutuhkan bantuan teknis? Tim pengelola Mamasar siap melayani Anda.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <!-- Kolom Kiri: Info Kontak & Alamat -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-2xs space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 border-l-4 border-emerald-600 pl-3">
          Sekretariat Layanan
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <AppIcon name="map-pin" size="xs" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-slate-900">Alamat Fisik</p>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">{SITE_CONFIG.address}</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <AppIcon name="whatsapp" size="xs" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-slate-900">WhatsApp Resmi</p>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">{SITE_CONFIG.whatsappHelp.replace(/^62/, '+62 ')}</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <AppIcon name="clock" size="xs" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-slate-900">Waktu Pelayanan</p>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">Senin – Sabtu: 08.00 – 16.00 WIB</p>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Ahad &amp; Hari Libur Nasional: Tanggap darurat via chat</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href={`https://wa.me/${SITE_CONFIG.whatsappHelp}?text=${encodeURIComponent("Assalamu'alaikum Pengurus Mamasar Sumenep, saya ingin bertanya mengenai...")}`}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-full min-h-[44px] px-5 py-2.5 bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-800 text-white font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm rounded-xl transition shadow-xs active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
          >
            <AppIcon name="whatsapp" size="xs" />
            <span>Chat WhatsApp Sekarang</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Kolom Kanan: Panduan Cepat Topik Layanan -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 border-l-4 border-emerald-600 pl-3">
          Topik Layanan Bantuan
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="p-3.5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs space-y-1">
            <p class="font-bold text-slate-900">1. Pelaporan &amp; Koreksi Toko</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
              Menemukan toko dengan nomor WhatsApp yang tidak aktif atau data keliru? Hubungi kami untuk pembaruan cepat.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3.5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs space-y-1">
            <p class="font-bold text-slate-900">2. Pendampingan Kader MWC &amp; Ranting</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
              Pengurus MWC NU yang membutuhkan akun petugas entri wilayah dapat berkoordinasi langsung dengan tim admin.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3.5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs space-y-1">
            <p class="font-bold text-slate-900">3. Kemitraan &amp; Kerjasama Santri</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
              Terbuka untuk program pemberdayaan produk santri pesantren, pupuk organik pekarangan, dan pameran UMKM.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
